WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.266
[Low Ominous Drone and Heavy Industrial Hammer Beat Intro]

00:00:24.266 --> 00:00:29.500
Kelsey's office. Three o'clock.

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:33.651
She said to come alone.

00:00:36.173 --> 00:00:40.255
The door is shut. The air is thick.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:46.450
A man in a uniform.

00:00:47.611 --> 00:00:51.200
My blood runs cold. My hands go numb.

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:54.000
I can't feel my own chair.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.157
He's holding out a folded sheet...

00:00:57.938 --> 00:01:02.000
This isn't real. This isn't fair.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:06.324
He looks at me, his face is grim

00:01:06.324 --> 00:01:08.800
He starts to read the line

00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:12.628
He doesn't know the words he holds

00:01:12.628 --> 00:01:18.580
Are a trigger to my mind...

00:01:27.419 --> 00:01:30.200
"Are you Aubrey Jordan Fuller?"

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:35.000
SYSTEM CRASH! THAT IS NOT MY NAME!

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:41.000
SYSTEM CRASH! SHE'S WON THE GAME!

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:46.964
HE'S HERE! SHE'S WON! THE WALLS ARE GONE!

00:01:47.044 --> 00:02:08.763
NO! NO! NO! NO!

00:02:08.984 --> 00:02:11.500
Can't breathe! Can't see!

00:02:11.500 --> 00:02:15.000
Rocking! Shaking!

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:18.010
The lights are bright!

00:02:18.010 --> 00:02:22.774
The world is breaking!

00:02:22.834 --> 00:02:28.000
He's just a man... A uniform...

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:33.318
He's just... her... He's her in here!

00:02:33.318 --> 00:02:51.318
[Crushing Industrial Assault]

00:02:51.318 --> 00:02:54.200
"Are you Aubrey Jordan Fuller?"

00:02:54.200 --> 00:02:59.000
SYSTEM CRASH! THAT IS NOT MY NAME!

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:05.000
SYSTEM CRASH! SHE'S WON THE GAME!

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:10.282
HE'S HERE! SHE'S WON! THE WALLS ARE GONE!

00:03:10.282 --> 00:03:25.000
NO! NO! NO! NO!

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:33.000
...gone... ...not me... ...not me...

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:51.480
[High-Pitched Electronic Flatline Drone Fades]
